2026-10-15T17:06:06.1882578Z   WP-B: Unified Action and Scope Model
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1883208Z     1. Unified Action and Resource Policy Resolver (actionPolicyService)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1884451Z       ✓ Super Admin can manage any user and any lab (2 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1885704Z       ✓ Lab Manager can manage subordinate in own lab, but not in another lab
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1886613Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot manage peer manager or project manager
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1887460Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot elevate technician to manager role (1 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1888484Z       ✓ Self-role change is rejected with SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1889390Z       ✓ Inactive actor is denied with ACTOR_INACTIVE
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1890035Z     2. Project-to-Lab Canonical Membership Resolver (projectMembershipService)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1891209Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (2 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1892217Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (3 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1893105Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager (1 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1893880Z     3. Assignable Roles Server Catalogue (GET /api/access/assignable-roles)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1894557Z       ✓ Super Admin gets all 10 roles in assignableRoles (22 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1895379Z       ✓ Lab Manager gets only ALLOWED_SUB_ROLES and sees peer/admin roles as unmanageable with reasons (6 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1896242Z       ✓ Ordinary viewer is denied access to assignable-roles (403 Forbidden) (10 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1897008Z       ✓ GET /api/access/capabilities returns platform role capabilities (6 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1897664Z     4. Work Assignment Eligibility & Validation (A23, LG-17, A33)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1898417Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to deactivated technician is rejected with ASSIGNEE_INACTIVE (400) (12 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1899179Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to technician in different lab is rejected with 403 (7 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1899886Z       ✓ A23: Assignment in paused/inactive lab is rejected with LAB_PAUSED (400) (13 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1900717Z       ✓ GET /api/work/eligible-assignees returns active analytical staff and excludes deactivated staff (8 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1901565Z     5. Staff Directory Scoping & Bounded Pagination (LG-08, LG-22)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1902276Z       ✓ LG-08: National user directory is strictly scoped to labs in authorized country (6 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1903030Z       ✓ LG-08: National user with empty country scope receives empty array (not global leak) (5 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1903825Z       ✓ GET /api/users/directory?purpose=assignment filters to active analytical staff (5 ms)
2026-10-15T17:06:06.1904664Z       ✓ GET /api/users enforces bounded pagination (clamps excessive limit to 100) and excludes password (8 ms)
